{"id":"n58810-1-11","stage":4,"title":"보답 · 报答","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58810-1-11-1","ko":"지난번에 나를 도와준 것이 고마워서 보답의 의미로 책을 한 권 샀어. 받아.","zh":"上次你帮了我，我很感激，所以特意买了一本书作为回报。收下吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지난번에","meaning":"上次，上回","explanation":"지난번：上次，上回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"지난번","audio":"/audio/0c2f1df517822c1fb603.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71316","senseId":"1","lemma":"지난번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나를","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도와준","meaning":"帮忙，帮助","explanation":"도와주다：帮忙，帮助；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"도와주다","audio":"/audio/1505f995680e9a46c72c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70744","senseId":"1","lemma":"도와주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것이","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고마워서","meaning":"感谢，感激","explanation":"고맙다：感谢，感激；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"고맙다","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20041","senseId":"1","lemma":"고맙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보답의","meaning":"报答，回报","explanation":"보답：报答，回报；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"보답","audio":"/audio/b07e1cc842421cca712b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58810","senseId":"1","lemma":"보답","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"의미로","meaning":"意义","explanation":"의미：意义；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"의미","audio":"/audio/adfc8cc897bfb433c0d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62385","senseId":"3","lemma":"의미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책을","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"한：一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"권","meaning":"本","explanation":"권：本","readings":[{"term":"권","audio":"/audio/5e113c9ef13b571371a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62537","senseId":"1","lemma":"권","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"샀어.","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받아.","meaning":"收到 ，得到","explanation":"받다：收到 ，得到；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"1","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"0c2f1df517822c1f","term":"지난번","zh":"上次，上回","audio":"/audio/0c2f1df517822c1fb603.mp3","entryId":"71316","definition":"以正在说话时为准，指过去的时候。","pronunciation":["지난번"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"1505f995680e9a46","term":"도와주다","zh":"帮忙，帮助","audio":"/audio/1505f995680e9a46c72c.mp3","entryId":"70744","definition":"帮别人做事或助人一臂之力。","pronunciation":["도와주다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"ded2b4943e89f57d","term":"고맙다","zh":"感谢，感激","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3","entryId":"20041","definition":"因别人为自己做了什么，内心感到很满足，并想给予回报。","pronunciation":["고ː맙따"]},{"id":"b07e1cc842421cca","term":"보답","zh":"报答，回报","audio":"/audio/b07e1cc842421cca712b.mp3","entryId":"58810","definition":"偿还从别人那里得到的恩惠或好意。","pronunciation":["보ː답"]},{"id":"adfc8cc897bfb433","term":"의미","zh":"意义","audio":"/audio/adfc8cc897bfb433c0d9.mp3","entryId":"62385","definition":"某事、行为、现象等具有的价值或重要性。","pronunciation":["의ː미"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一个的。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"5e113c9ef13b5713","term":"권","zh":"本","audio":"/audio/5e113c9ef13b571371a0.mp3","entryId":"62537","definition":"计算书或本子的数量单位。","pronunciation":["권"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"收到 ，得到","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"拿到他人给的或送来的东西。","pronunciation":["받따"]}],"audio":"/audio/78b421d138b80b9f8209.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58810-1-11-2","ko":"와, 고마워. 잘 읽을게.","zh":"哇，谢谢。我会好好读的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"와,","meaning":"啊，咦","explanation":"와：啊，咦","readings":[{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17872","senseId":"1","lemma":"와","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고마워.","meaning":"感谢，感激","explanation":"고맙다：感谢，感激；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"고맙다","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20041","senseId":"1","lemma":"고맙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"읽을게.","meaning":"阅读","explanation":"읽다：阅读；을게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"읽다","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68752","senseId":"2","lemma":"읽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d536e6255a4151ea","term":"와","zh":"啊，咦","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3","entryId":"17872","definition":"遇到惊喜时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["와"]},{"id":"ded2b4943e89f57d","term":"고맙다","zh":"感谢，感激","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3","entryId":"20041","definition":"因别人为自己做了什么，内心感到很满足，并想给予回报。","pronunciation":["고ː맙따"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"f843025cff483034","term":"읽다","zh":"阅读","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3","entryId":"68752","definition":"看文字了解其意思。","pronunciation":["익따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ba0099055e828a686b6c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.933,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58810","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":141,"sequenceScore":2.7597,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["哇，谢谢。我会好好读的。","你最好先向哥哥道歉。","上次你帮了我，我很感激，所以特意买了一本书作为回报。收下吧。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["哇，谢谢。我会好好读的。","上次你帮了我，我很感激，所以特意买了一本书作为回报。收下吧。","你最好先向哥哥道歉。"],"answer":0}]}
